{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Domain Event.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Domain Event.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"domain event domain event","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Domain Event.md","fileName":"Domain Event.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Domain Event","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-22 20:53\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[EventStorming Collaborative Modeling]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["EventStorming Collaborative Modeling","Event Timeline","Domain Entity","Aggregate","Event Sourcing","hands-ondomain-drivendesignwithnetcore.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Domain Event.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Domain Event.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"domain event domain event","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Domain Event.md","fileName":"Domain Event.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Domain Event","heading":"Domain Event","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A domain event is a fact that changed the state of the domain. It describes something that happened, not something an actor wanted to do, so EventStorming names it with a subject and a past-tense verb such as “Order Confirmed.” Events are placed on an [[Event Timeline]] to reveal causal and temporal relationships. In implementation, the same fact can become an object raised by a [[Domain Entity]] or [[Aggregate]] and later stored through [[Event Sourcing]].\n\nThe source raises a domain event when a business-significant state change occurs and dispatches it to decoupled handlers. The event allows additional reactions without embedding every consequence inside the aggregate operation.","tags":["baby"],"links":["EventStorming Collaborative Modeling","Event Timeline","Domain Entity","Aggregate","Event Sourcing","hands-ondomain-drivendesignwithnetcore.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Domain Event.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Domain Event.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"domain event domain event","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Domain Event.md","fileName":"Domain Event.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Domain Event","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[hands-onsoftwarearchitecturewithc8andnetcore3.pdf]]\n\n[[hands-ondomain-drivendesignwithnetcore.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["EventStorming Collaborative Modeling","Event Timeline","Domain Entity","Aggregate","Event Sourcing","hands-ondomain-drivendesignwithnetcore.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}